{"story":{"eyebrow":"Our Story","headline":"Where Every Petal Carries A Promise","body":"ELAROSE began at a kitchen table, with one bouquet, one girl, and one belief: that gifting can be a love language. Today, we hand-craft luxury keepsakes for the moments you never want to forget.","image":"https://images.pexels.com/photos/931177/pexels-photo-931177.jpeg?auto=compress&cs=tinysrgb&w=1200","imageAlt":"ELAROSE handcrafted bouquet close up"},"mission":{"icon":"sparkles","title":"Our Mission","body":"To slow down gifting. To make it intentional, handmade, and unforgettable. We craft gifts that feel like heirlooms — never disposable, never ordinary."},"vision":{"icon":"sparkles","title":"Our Vision","body":"A world where every milestone is wrapped in something handmade. Where the giver feels as cherished as the receiver. Where luxury is measured in love, not in logos."},"process":{"eyebrow":"Process","headline":"Our Crafting Process","steps":[{"number":"01","title":"Listen","description":"We meet you on Instagram and learn the story behind the gift."},{"number":"02","title":"Design","description":"Our artisans sketch a unique piece, choosing fabrics and florals."},{"number":"03","title":"Craft","description":"Hours of slow handwork, petal by petal, ribbon by ribbon."},{"number":"04","title":"Wrap","description":"Signature ivory wrap, blush ribbon, gold seal. Then to your love."}]},"timeline":{"eyebrow":"Timeline","headline":"From a Single Bouquet, A Brand Was Born","events":[{"year":"2022","title":"A bouquet for a friend","description":"It all started with a single pipe cleaner bouquet, gifted on a quiet Tuesday."},{"year":"2023","title":"ELAROSE is born","description":"We opened our DMs and the first 100 orders arrived within a month."},{"year":"2024","title":"Studio launch","description":"A tiny boutique studio became home to our growing artisan team."},{"year":"2025","title":"Pan-India delivery","description":"From Mumbai to Manipur — gifts are now travelling everywhere love does."}]}}